second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What position does John Greny currently or formerly hold?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 96, \"text\": \"In the heart of the Roman Catholic Church, a revered figure emerged to guide the faithful flock.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 97, \"end\": 234, \"text\": \"John Greny, a devoted servant of the Lord, had been entrusted with the sacred responsibility of leading a diocese as its diocesan bishop.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 235, \"end\": 399, \"text\": \"This esteemed position, one of great trust and authority, was not taken lightly, and Greny's appointment was a testament to his unwavering commitment to the Church.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 400, \"end\": 499, \"text\": \"As the bishop in pastoral charge of his diocese, Greny's duties were multifaceted and far-reaching.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 500, \"end\": 660, \"text\": \"He was responsible for the spiritual well-being of his congregation, providing guidance, support, and wisdom to those seeking solace in the teachings of Christ.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 661, \"end\": 830, \"text\": \"His role was not limited to mere ceremonial duties, but rather, he was an active shepherd, tending to the needs of his flock with compassion, empathy, and understanding.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 831, \"end\": 1000, \"text\": \"One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Greny's position as diocesan bishop was his involvement in the appointment of parish priests within his diocese.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1001, \"end\": 1178, \"text\": \"As the spiritual leader of his community, it was his duty to identify and ordain worthy candidates to serve as priests, ensuring the continued growth and vitality of the Church.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1179, \"end\": 1384, \"text\": \"This responsibility was not taken lightly, and Greny's careful consideration and discernment in this process demonstrated his deep understanding of the Church's teachings and his commitment to its mission.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1385, \"end\": 1505, \"text\": \"Furthermore, Greny's role in the governance of his diocese was another key indicator of his position as diocesan bishop.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1506, \"end\": 1686, \"text\": \"He was responsible for overseeing the administration of the diocese, making key decisions regarding the allocation of resources, and ensuring the financial stability of the Church.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1687, \"end\": 1886, \"text\": \"This level of authority and responsibility was a hallmark of a diocesan bishop, and Greny's leadership in this regard was a testament to his ability to navigate the complexities of Church governance.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1887, \"end\": 2034, \"text\": \"In addition, Greny's participation in regional and national ecclesiastical gatherings provided further evidence of his position as diocesan bishop.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2035, \"end\": 2241, \"text\": \"As a respected voice within the Church, he was often called upon to share his insights and expertise with fellow bishops and clergy, providing guidance on matters of doctrine, discipline, and pastoral care.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2242, \"end\": 2392, \"text\": \"His involvement in these gatherings demonstrated his recognition as a leader within the Church, and his contributions were highly valued by his peers.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2393, \"end\": 2495, \"text\": \"The sacramental life of the Church was another area where Greny's role as diocesan bishop was evident.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 84, \"text\": \"**BREAKING: Bishop John Greny Makes History as First Clergy to Hold US Senate Seat**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 86, \"end\": 289, \"text\": \"In a shocking turn of events, Bishop John Greny, a respected member of the Roman Catholic Church, has been sworn in as a United States senator, marking a historic first for the nation's legislative body.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 290, \"end\": 501, \"text\": \"The 55-year-old bishop, known for his progressive stance on social issues and commitment to community service, was appointed to the Senate seat vacated by the sudden resignation of Senator James Reed last month.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 502, \"end\": 695, \"text\": \"Greny's unexpected rise to the position has sent ripples through the political and religious communities, with many hailing it as a beacon of hope for bipartisanship and interfaith cooperation.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 696, \"end\": 851, \"text\": \"\\\"I am humbled and honored to serve the people of this great nation in this new capacity,\\\" Bishop Greny said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 852, \"end\": 1045, \"text\": \"\\\"As a man of faith, I believe it is my duty to work towards the betterment of society, and I look forward to collaborating with my colleagues to address the pressing issues facing our country.\\\"\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1046, \"end\": 1161, \"text\": \"Greny's appointment has been met with widespread support from religious leaders across the denominational spectrum.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1162, \"end\": 1299, \"text\": \"\\\"This is a momentous day for people of faith everywhere,\\\" said Rabbi David Levine, president of the Interfaith Council of Washington D.C.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1300, \"end\": 1429, \"text\": \"\\\"Bishop Greny's commitment to social justice and his ability to bring people together make him an ideal candidate for this role.\\\"\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1430, \"end\": 1568, \"text\": \"According to data from the Pew Research Center, Greny's appointment marks a significant shift in the religious demographics of the Senate.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1569, \"end\": 1665, \"text\": \"With his addition, Catholics now make up 27% of the Senate, up from 22% in the previous session.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1666, \"end\": 1803, \"text\": \"Greny's legislative priorities are expected to focus on issues such as poverty reduction, education reform, and environmental protection.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1804, \"end\": 1912, \"text\": \"\\\"As a bishop, I have seen firsthand the devastating impact of poverty on families and communities,\\\" he said.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1913, \"end\": 2072, \"text\": \"\\\"I am committed to working with my colleagues to craft legislation that addresses the root causes of poverty and promotes economic mobility for all Americans.\\\"\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2073, \"end\": 2256, \"text\": \"The bishop's swearing-in ceremony, attended by leaders from various faith traditions and political parties, was a testament to his ability to build bridges across ideological divides.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2257, \"end\": 2414, \"text\": \"\\\"Today, we put aside our differences and come together in the spirit of unity and cooperation,\\\" said Senate Majority Leader, Mitch McConnell, in a statement.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2415, \"end\": 2510, \"text\": \"\\\"I look forward to working with Bishop Greny to address the pressing issues facing our nation.\\\"\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"John Greny\", \"scope\": \"current or former\", \"claim\": \"John Greny currently or formerly holds the position of diocesan bishop.\", \"answer\": \"diocesan bishop\", \"quote\": \"John Greny, a devoted servant of the Lord, had been entrusted with the sacred responsibility of leading a diocese as its diocesan bishop.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"diocesan bishop\", \"United States senator\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"diocesan bishop\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"United States senator\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
